@app = http://localhost:8102
@manage = http://localhost:9102/manage
@ops = Basic b3BzOm9wcw==
@dev = Basic ZGV2OmRldg==

### public health (status only)
GET {{manage}}/health

### health with details (ops)
GET {{manage}}/health
Authorization: {{ops}}

### probes on the app port
GET {{app}}/readyz

###
GET {{app}}/livez

### readiness group with the custom indicator
GET {{manage}}/health/readiness
Authorization: {{ops}}

### simulate payment gateway outage
POST {{app}}/api/payment-gateway/down

### back up
POST {{app}}/api/payment-gateway/up

### maintenance mode (readiness REFUSING_TRAFFIC)
POST {{app}}/api/maintenance/on

###
POST {{app}}/api/maintenance/off

### info: build, env, java, os, custom contributor
GET {{manage}}/info

### wrong role -> 403
GET {{manage}}/metrics
Authorization: {{dev}}

### custom endpoint: read all
GET {{manage}}/features
Authorization: {{ops}}

### custom endpoint: write
POST {{manage}}/features/new-checkout
Authorization: {{ops}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": true}

### app reads the flag
GET {{app}}/api/checkout

### custom endpoint: delete
DELETE {{manage}}/features/dark-mode
Authorization: {{ops}}

### change log level at runtime
POST {{manage}}/loggers/com.paravar.ops
Authorization: {{ops}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"configuredLevel": "DEBUG"}

### masked secret
GET {{manage}}/env/app.payment.api-token
Authorization: {{ops}}

### startup timeline
GET {{manage}}/startup
Authorization: {{ops}}

### last HTTP exchanges
GET {{manage}}/httpexchanges
Authorization: {{ops}}

### graceful shutdown
POST {{manage}}/shutdown
Authorization: {{ops}}
